#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset links to a Simulink model of a steering controller that replaces the steering wheel angle determined by the built-in CarSim model.
#
#It makes use of the driver sensors built into CarSim for previewing the target path and giving feedback about predicted tracking error (L_DRV_1, LDRV_2, ...,) and the integral of the tracking error (A_DRV_1, A_DRV_2, ...).
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

